<title>HONG KONG: Lap Heng interim net falls 35.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Lap Heng interim net falls 35.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   67.0  vs  105.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil   vs  20.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    37.97 vs  58.88</p>
<p>    Turnover		     48.13 vs  296.82</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lap Heng Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Watch manufacturer and distributor Lap Heng is also engaged in investment holding and property management. The company did not distribute any cash bonus, compared with HK$0.60 in a year earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
